    "location": "North east of Dragonblaze Peaks in Zao during the announced dragons raid, up to 10 draptors per raid in [http://tibia.wikia.com/wiki/Mapper?coords=129.235-121.223-7-2-1-0&mark1=129.210-121.212-7-9&mark2=129.194-121.251-7-9&mark3=129.165-122.4-7-9&mark4=130.6-122.17-7-9&mark5=130.51-121.210-7-9&mark6=129.230-121.186-7-9&mark7=130.11-121.182-7-9 these spots]. Furthermore, 2 to 4 Draptors may also appear inside the Emperor's Castle in Razachai in two diferent [https://tibia.fandom.com/wiki/Mapper?coords=129.55-121.127-10-4-1-1&mark1=129.84-121.105-10-9&mark2=129.31-121.140-10-9 rooms]. This raid is independent of Dragons raid and happens every 5 to 7 days.",
