    "bestiaryOccurrence": "Common",
    "imageUrl": "https://static.tibia.com/images/library/fruitdrop.gif",
    "description": "These candy creatures are downright cheerful fellows. When they roam Candia's surface, they like to play hide and seek in the lollipop fields or between the peppermint trees. If they work in the chocolate mines, they are in charge of adding fruit essences and extracts to the chocolate, to enhance and add flavour to the mix. They are very friendly and sweet (both figuratively and literally), and enjoy working with the different fruits and experimenting with new flavour combinations. They add the special touches to the chocolate, such as fruit peels, extracts, and essences. Fruit drops are creative and innovative, always looking for ways to make the chocolate mixture more delicious and pleasing to the senses. The fruit drops and their mint drop cousins also keep the big ice cream machine underneath the gingerbread palace going.",
