    "imageUrl": "https://static.tibia.com/images/library/hawkhopper.gif",
    "description": "Hawk hoppers are bizarre and fascinating creatures, a caprice of nature that once thrived in the forests of Tibia. They are a mixture of rabbit and bird, with soft fur, long ears, powerful bird legs, and feathered wings. They move very quickly, can jump high into the air with their legs, and glide over the treetops with their wings. They are both cute and unpredictable, and some believe they bring good luck, while others consider them messengers of misfortune. However, stories tell that they disappeared from the forests long ago. They were considered shy and reserved creatures that rarely showed themselves to humans. However, it is said that they were familiar with the elves of Tibia and sometimes acted as their loyal companions.",
