    "imageUrl": "https://static.tibia.com/images/library/imperial.gif",
    "description": "While red deer is known as a stag or hart, an imperial has a specific type of antler, known as a 14-pointer. On the Isle of Ada, home of Eldoran the Ambitious and his knights, there have been sightings of a specifically rare breed with silver gray fur. While it is allowed to hunt deer on the isle, the knights of the Stag have strict rules concerning the population of their game. Knights only hunt as many deer as needed or to keep their number in check in regards to nature and the other wildlife roaming their homeland. The silver imperial is said to have the most tender venison and majestic fur which some of the knights of the Stag use to garnish their armour. Not out of vanity, but out of respect.",
