    "imageUrl": "https://static.tibia.com/images/library/jaracal.gif",
    "description": "The jaracals are six-legged feline predators native to Marapur. They are equally at home in the dense jungle and along the submerging coastline of the Emerald Gardens. Their additional limbs grant them remarkable balance, allowing them to change direction very quickly and to outmaneuver almost any prey. \n\nJaracals are patient hunters, stalking their targets silently before striking. Their keen senses and sharp instincts make them difficult to surprise. Despite their ferocity, though, they can be tamed. Those who earn their trust may find them to be loyal and capable companions.",
