    "imageUrl": "https://static.tibia.com/images/library/lionhydra.gif",
    "description": "The lion hydra is a creature that is as majestic as it is terrifying. A cross between the royal dignity of the lion and the treacherous brutality of the hydra, it is a symbol of how stories connect the terrible and the beautiful. Its front half is that of a mighty lion, with muscular limbs, sharp claws, and a fearsome set of teeth. But instead of a normal mane, its head is adorned with a tangle of hissing snakes. Its rear half is that of a serpentine monster whose scales shimmer in the colors of the ocean. It moves with great speed and grace, both on land and in water, and can breathe fire like a dragon. In ancient stories, a lion hydra could be both helpful and destructive. But if one encountered one, it was always best to prepare for battle.",
