    "imageUrl": "https://static.tibia.com/images/library/lizardcommander.gif",
    "description": "Hidden deep inside ancient ruins and forsaken temples, a new green-scaled lizard tribe has arisen from the shadows. These reptiles serve the head of the clan by following every order in pursuit of a greater cause. The clan gathers resources, recruits new members and trains in secrecy to build up strength in order to accomplish their yet unknown goals.\n\nThe commander is the undisputed leader of the clan, ruling with military authority and unmatched combat expertise. Armed with a uniquely crafted poisonous spear and a massive scale shield, the commander has everything he needs to defeat any enemy coming its way. Although it still remains uncertain which corrupted ritual the fierce commander had to endure in order to claim their lead. Undoubtedly, witchcraft and sacrifice had to be a part of the ascension.",
