    "description": "Hidden deep inside ancient ruins and forsaken temples, a new green-scaled lizard tribe has arisen from the shadows. These reptiles serve the head of the clan by following every order in pursuit of a greater cause. The clan gathers resources, recruits new members and trains in secrecy to build up strength in order to accomplish their yet unknown goals.\n\nThe Lizard Executioner represents the highest achievable rank in the hidden lizard clan, only receiving contracts from the commander himself. Due to their mysterious darker appearance, these elite warriors specialise in nightly sabotage, capture or assassination of high-value targets. Equipped with high-tier equipment and perfect expertise in combat, this scaled warrior is feared by those how know about their still mysterious origins.",
