    "imageUrl": "https://static.tibia.com/images/library/lizardswordmaster.gif",
    "description": "Hidden deep inside ancient ruins and forsaken temples, a new green-scaled lizard tribe has arisen from the shadows. These reptiles serve the head of the clan by following every order in pursuit of a greater cause. The clan gathers resources, recruits new members and trains in secrecy to build up strength in order to accomplish their yet unknown goals.\n\nSwordmasters have perfected close-up sword combat using the signature scytheblade coated in an unknown poisonous substance. Due to their higher rank in the military, swordmasters are granted superior armour and equipment, making them more durable and even more dangerous than the lower-ranked combatants. They are also entrusted with commanding warriors beneath them, leading them into battle with experience and unmatched discipline.",
