    "imageUrl": "https://static.tibia.com/images/library/nightharpy.gif",
    "description": "Compared to their congeneric sisters, these nocturnal creatures only ever hunt at night. Their feathers blend with the inky black of the night and wrap them into a cloak of darkness whilst stalking their unsuspecting prey. They attack in flocks and with swift precision before disappearing into the dark as quickly as they came. There numbers have grown lately and they have started to nest ever closer to  and even larger settlements. Their roost often conceals a collection of valuable objects, shiny stones and other treasure. This stash is well-hidden, however, and the only time they leave it unguarded is in the dead of night.",
