    "imageUrl": "https://static.tibia.com/images/library/quararaider.gif",
    "description": "Quara Raiders are the embodiment of unbridled greed and savagery, even among their own ruthless kin. These crab-like creatures possess a hardened exoskeleton and immense strength, making them a force to be reckoned with on the battlefield. Their insatiable lust for wealth and bloodshed has led to their exile from Quara society, leaving them to roam the depths in search of plunder.\nAs mercenaries, Quara Raiders are employed to strike fear in the hearts of the enemy. Their sheer ferocity makes them difficult to control or employ in any subtle tactics. Cunning employers often attempt to contain their fury, only unleashing these terrifying creatures upon their enemies when the time is right.",
