    "imageUrl": "https://static.tibia.com/images/library/raubritterchastener.gif",
    "description": "In the heyday of the order, the Stags were a ragtag bunch of all kinds of scoundrels, daredevils. Not only did they have a firm code of honour, they also adhered to strict rituals and cultivated a powerful magic school. The chasteners were the prime keepers of the lore and magical heritage of the Order of the Stag. In heated battles and conquests across the lands of Tibia, they were the first line of defense conjuring devastating elemental spells and erecting powerful magical shields while also leading the charge at the turn of many a battle, when morale was low and the flesh weak.",
