    "imageUrl": "https://static.tibia.com/images/library/raubrittermarksman.gif",
    "description": "Even before the dark influence of the warlock, the ranged skills of these marksmen were unmatched while their cunning prowess in battle saved the order countless times. As hard as the arrows of raubritter marksmen hit, the speed of their swift attacks prevents countermeasures and forces adversaries into their defence. Opening such tactical windows, these snipers allowed fellow knights to fall in quickly and press the attack. Through the spells of their dark master, they became even more dangerous: high-powered fighting machines, unscrupulous and far from feeling pain the way a human does.",
