    "imageUrl": "https://static.tibia.com/images/library/raubritterskirmisher.gif",
    "description": "Once proud knights of the Order of the Stag, these battle-hardened veterans are tough and experienced. When the warlock was marshalling his puppet forces, these relentless warriors formed the forefront. Spearheading most of the attacks on the bastion of the order, these skirmishers are often the first and the last terrifying sight of a poor guardsman standing watch during the onslaught. Once they locked-in on an enemy, they are hard to get away from and even harder to bring down. Due to the warlock's spells, they are not only controlled to willingly fulfill his every request but also further protected against a variety of physical and magical attacks.",
