    "description": "Bug Trackers are the versatile workforce of the plant people, occupying the roles of hunters, gatherers, and farmers within their peculiar society. Although they are human-sized beings, their forms are more insectoid, allowing them to fulfill their tasks with unmatched efficiency. These adaptive creatures possess a unique connection to the complex network of flora and fauna that thrive within their colossal plant home, enabling them to locate the most abundant resources and hunt down any potential threats.\nThey maintain the delicate balance of their ecosystem, ensuring that their people have a steady supply of food and materials. When not tending to their duties, they hone their skills in combat, preparing to protect their civilisation from harm.",
