    "imageUrl": "https://static.tibia.com/images/library/shelldrake.gif",
    "description": "Shell drakes are bizarre creatures that appear in some fairy tales. They are an absurd combination of dragon and snail. Their long, snake-like necks emerge from a giant snail shell standing on bird legs. Their mouths are pointed and beak-like, and they have three horns. Two dragon wings emerge from the large snail shell. Like dragons, shell drakes can breathe fire that can destroy all life in their vicinity. Although the middle of their bodies consists of a snail shell, don't be fooled: Shell drakes can move extremely fast when they want to. According to legend, they are the guardians of the forgotten paths that lead through the dark forests of Tibia.",
