    "description": "The winged jaracals are the result of asuri experimentation. The natural predators have been twisted by moonsilver and dark asuri magic. Their bodies retain their speed and agility, but their form is altered: They have grown a pair of demonic wings. Unlike their natural counterparts, the winged jaracals show relentless aggression rather than patience. The demonic corruption has dulled their instincts but amplified their ferocity, turning them into creatures that hunt out of compulsion, not out of necessity.",
